{"speciesId":422,"names":{"fr":"Sancoki","es":"Shellos","en":"Shellos","ja":"カラナクシ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Its colors and shapes differ from region to region. In the Sinnoh region, two types are confirmed."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It lives along bodies of water. Its body shape has changed to suit its habitat."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Beware of pushing strongly on its squishy body, as it makes a mysterious purple fluid ooze out."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Its shape and coloration vary, depending on its habitat."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Its shape and coloration vary, depending on its habitat."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Un étrange liquide mauve s’échappe de son corps, ne lui appuyez pas dessus."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Beware of pushing strongly on its squishy body, as it makes a mysterious purple fluid ooze out."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Un étrange liquide mauve s’échappe de son corps, ne lui appuyez pas dessus."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Beware of pushing strongly on its squishy body, as it makes a mysterious purple fluid ooze out."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Beware of pushing strongly on its squishy body, as it makes a mysterious purple fluid ooze out."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Beware of pushing strongly on its squishy body, as it makes a mysterious purple fluid ooze out."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Un étrange liquide mauve s’échappe de son corps, ne lui appuyez pas dessus."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"No hay que apretarle muy fuerte, ya que, si lo haces, secreta un misterioso fluido morado."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Beware of pushing strongly on its squishy body, as it makes a mysterious purple fluid ooze out."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"やわらかい 体を 強く押すと 紫色の ナゾの 液体が にじみ出るので 要注意。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il change facilement de couleur ou de forme en fonction de son environnement."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Shellos adapta la forma y color de su cuerpo dependiendo del lugar en donde viva."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Its shape and coloration vary, depending on its habitat."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"住む 場所の 環境に よって 体の 形や 色が 変化しやすい ポケモンだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Un étrange liquide mauve s’échappe de son corps, ne lui appuyez pas dessus."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"No hay que apretarle muy fuerte, ya que, si lo haces, secreta un misterioso fluido morado."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Beware of pushing strongly on its squishy body, as it makes a mysterious purple fluid ooze out."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"やわらかい 体を 強く押すと 紫色の ナゾの 液体が にじみ出るので 要注意。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il change facilement de couleur ou de forme en fonction de son environnement."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Shellos adapta la forma y color de su cuerpo dependiendo del lugar en donde viva."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Its shape and coloration vary, depending on its habitat."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"住む 場所の 環境に よって 体の 形や 色が 変化しやすい ポケモンだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Il vit principalement sur les rivages rocheux. Sa forme et sa couleur peuvent varier selon son environnement et son alimentation."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Suele vivir cerca del agua y su forma y color varían en función de factores como su hábitat o su alimentación."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"For the most part, it makes its home along the seashore. Its color and form differ according to its habitat and the quality of its food."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"磯が 主な 棲みか。 生息地の 環境や 餌の 質で 色や 姿が 異なる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Au toucher, une sécrétion mauve se dépose sur les mains. Faites bien attention, car elle ne part vraiment pas facilement, même en lavant bien."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Al tocarlo, segrega un fluido violáceo que mancha las manos y que es extremadamente difícil de eliminar aún tras repetidos lavados."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"Purple mucus sticks to the hands of anyone who touches it. Take care, as the substance is troublesome to wash off."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"触ると 紫の 粘液が 手に つくぞ。 洗っても 洗っても なかなか 落ちないので 注意。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il vit normalement dans la mer, mais il peut aussi s’installer sur la terre ferme, tant que sa peau reste humide."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Por lo general suele habitar en el agua, pero también puede moverse por tierra firme siempre y cuando su piel no se reseque por completo."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"While they normally live in the sea, they can function on land, too, until their skin dries out."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"普段 海の中に 暮らしているが 皮膚が 乾燥 するまでなら 陸地でも 活動 できるぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il sécrète un liquide mauve lorsqu’il se sent en danger. Il s’agirait d’un phénomène similaire aux sueurs froides."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Cuando se siente amenazado, secreta un fluido morado. Según se cree, podría tratarse de un fenómeno similar al de los sudores fríos."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"When it senses danger, a purple liquid oozes out of it. The liquid is thought to be something like greasy sweat."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"危険を 感じると 紫色の 汁を だす。 あぶら汗の ような ものだと 考えられている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Son apparence change selon son environnement. On raconte qu’il adopte celle-ci dans les mers chaudes."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Su aspecto cambia según el entorno. Al parecer, esta es la forma que adopta en mares de aguas cálidas."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"This Pokémon’s habitat shapes its physique. According to some theories, life in warm ocean waters causes this variation to develop."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"環境で 姿が 変わる。 水温が 温かい 海では この姿に なるという 説も。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Si on le caresse trop fort, il sécrète un étrange liquide mauve qui est inoffensif, mais dont la texture est très gluante."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Si se le aprieta muy fuerte, secreta un misterioso fluido morado que, aunque inofensivo, resulta desagradable por su viscosidad."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Subjecting this Pokémon to a strong force causes it to secrete a strange purple fluid. Though harmless, the fluid is awfully sticky."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"強く 触れると 紫色の 謎の 汁を 出す。 害は ないけれど ネバネバするよ。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"Found in abundance on seashores bordering warm waters. Shellos are unexpectedly friendly and will crawl toward any person they see. Take care not to get coated in mucus!"}],"varieties":[{"id":422,"moves":[{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[10,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[24,"level-up",5]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[8,"level-up",29],[9,"level-up",29],[10,"level-up",29],[11,"level-up",29],[14,"level-up",29],[15,"level-up",29],[16,"level-up",29],[17,"level-up",29],[18,"level-up",29],[20,"level-up",25],[20,"machine",0],[23,"level-up",25],[25,"level-up",25],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"mist","learns":[[11,"egg",0],[14,"egg",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[20,"egg",0],[23,"egg",0],[25,"egg",0]]},{"name":"water-gun","learns":[[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"hydro-pump","learns":[[20,"machine",0],[24,"level-up",47],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"surf","learns":[[8,"machine"